sec.p:
One- or two-compartment model with first-order elimination were evaluated for ARI and DARI. Since the lack of absorption and distribution phase data, the parameters were difficult to be estimated by two-compartment model. Therefore, two one-compartment tandem models were applied in the construction of the base model for both ARI and DARI. According to the reports in the literature, the absorption rate constant (k

a
) was fixed at 1.06 h−1 (Jovanovic et al., 2020), and the bioavailability (F) was not estimated. The material balance formulas were shown in Equations 1-3.
